====Usage notes====
Though the 'h' is silent at the beginning, the word and its derivations are always considered to begin in a consonant, so you say '''''la H'''ongrie, en Hongrie /'''ɑ̃ õ'''ɡʁi/, '''le H'''ongrois, '''la H'''ongroise ''and'' les Hongrois(es) /'''le õ'''ɡʁwa(z)/'', etc...

